<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy" appName="Prep & Provide" lastUpdated="October 19, 2026">

  <p>
    This Privacy Policy describes how <strong>Refuge &amp; Sword Publishing LLC</strong> ("we," "us," or "our")
    collects, uses, and protects information in connection with the <strong>Prep &amp; Provide</strong>
    application ("the App"). We are committed to protecting your privacy and being straightforward
    about how your data is handled.
  </p>

  <p>
    Questions? Contact us at <a href="mailto:dustin@refugeandsword.com" style="color: var(--heritage-gold);">dustin@refugeandsword.com</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
  <p>We collect only what is necessary to provide the App's features:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Account information:</strong> Your email address and a securely hashed password, used to authenticate you and maintain your account.</li>
    <li><strong>Meal plans:</strong> Weekly and custom meal plans you create within the App.</li>
    <li><strong>Recipes:</strong> Recipes you save, create, or import into the App.</li>
    <li><strong>Grocery lists:</strong> Shopping lists generated from your meal plans or added manually.</li>
    <li><strong>Recipe photos:</strong> Images you upload to a recipe, and images you supply when importing a recipe from a photo or PDF.</li>
    <li><strong>Household membership:</strong> Which household you belong to, your display name within it, and your role.</li>
    <li><strong>Subscription status:</strong> Whether you have an active Family subscription and when it expires, received from our payment provider.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do <strong>not</strong> collect your name, location, phone number, device identifiers, advertising identifiers, usage analytics, or any other personal data beyond what is listed above.</p>

  <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
  <p>Your information is used solely to provide and support the App's functionality:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>To authenticate your identity when you log in.</li>
    <li>To store and sync your meal plans, recipes, and grocery lists across sessions and devices.</li>
    <li>To operate recipe import and grocery list consolidation, as described in Section 4.</li>
    <li>To respond to support requests you initiate with us.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not use your information for advertising, marketing profiling, or any automated decision-making.</p>

  <h2>3. Automated Recipe Import and Grocery Consolidation</h2>
  <p>
    The App can import a recipe from a web link, a photo, or a PDF, and can combine the ingredients
    across your weekly plan into a single grocery list. These features use a third-party artificial
    intelligence provider to read and organise the text.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>When you use one of these features, the relevant content is sent to that provider to be processed: the text of the page you linked, the photo or PDF you supplied, or the ingredient list from your meal plan.</li>
    <li>Your email address, password, and account identifiers are <strong>not</strong> sent.</li>
    <li>The content is processed to return a result to you. It is not used to train the provider's models.</li>
    <li>These features run only when you start them. Nothing is sent automatically in the background.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Information Sharing</h2>
  <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information, and we do not share it with anyone for their own purposes. We use a small number of service providers to operate the App, and they may process your information only on our behalf:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Hosting and database:</strong> Your account, recipes, meal plans, grocery lists, and uploaded photos are stored with our cloud hosting and database provider, on servers in the United States.</li>
    <li><strong>Web hosting:</strong> Our web application is served by a hosting provider, which processes standard request data such as IP addresses in order to deliver the site.</li>
    <li><strong>Artificial intelligence provider:</strong> As described in Section 3, recipe and ingredient content is sent for processing when you use recipe import or grocery consolidation.</li>
    <li><strong>Email delivery:</strong> Account emails, such as sign-up confirmation and password resets, are sent through an email delivery provider, which receives your email address.</li>
    <li><strong>Payments and subscriptions:</strong> Subscriptions are processed by Google Play. We receive your subscription status through a subscription management provider. We never receive or store your payment card details.</li>
    <li><strong>Legal compliance:</strong> We may disclose information if required by law, court order, or to protect the rights and safety of our users or the public.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>5. Household Sharing</h2>
  <p>
    The App lets you share a household with other people. Everyone in a household can see and change
    that household's recipes, meal plans, and grocery lists, and can see the display names of the
    other members. Content belongs to the household rather than to the person who created it, so it
    remains with the household if you leave or delete your account while others are still in it.
  </p>
  <p>
    An invite link grants access to whoever opens it while it is valid, so share it only with people
    you intend to invite. Invites expire, and you can revoke a pending invite at any time.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Amazon Alexa</h2>
  <p>
    Prep &amp; Provide previously offered an Amazon Alexa voice integration using OAuth 2.0 account
    linking. <strong>This integration is not currently available.</strong> If it is reinstated, this
    policy will be updated before any data is shared with Amazon.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Data Retention</h2>
  <p>
    We retain your account information and app data for as long as your account remains active.
    You can delete your account and all associated data directly within the App at any time.
    Upon deletion, your data will be permanently removed from our systems within 30 days,
    except where retention is required by law.
  </p>

  <h2>8. How to Delete Your Account</h2>
  <p>
    You can delete your Prep &amp; Provide account and all associated data from within the App.
    See our <a href="/legal/delete-account-prep-and-provide" style="color: var(--heritage-gold);">account deletion page</a> for step-by-step instructions.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>
    Prep &amp; Provide is not directed to children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect
    personal information from children under 13. If you believe a child under 13 has provided us
    with personal information, please contact us and we will promptly delete it.
  </p>

  <h2>10. Security</h2>
  <p>
    We take reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your information against
    unauthorized access, loss, or misuse. However, no method of transmission over the internet
    or electronic storage is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
  </p>

  <h2>11. Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will update the
    "Last updated" date at the top of this page. Continued use of the App after changes
    are posted constitutes your acceptance of the updated policy.
  </p>

  <h2>12. Contact Us</h2>
  <p>
    If you have questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:<br />
    <strong>Refuge &amp; Sword Publishing LLC</strong><br />
    Springfield, Missouri<br />
    <a href="mailto:dustin@refugeandsword.com" style="color: var(--heritage-gold);">dustin@refugeandsword.com</a>
  </p>

</LegalLayout>
